{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area02_title", "source_sha256": "b63aac97db1e71efbe4c62c40dd4ecc435ac21e80b739095eb642ab0421a28c9", "ja": "お稲荷様は見ている？", "zh": "稻荷神在看着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5a904384bd80f4646b3cc620627b36867853e05d19c9a2b8494d3631d009104c", "ja": "ツアーの合間に、伏見稲荷大社へ観光にきた\n歩、昴、茜。歩は無数の鳥居に圧倒される。\n元気が有り余っている昴が狐を探しに行こう\nとするのを止める歩と茜。茜は、商売繁盛の\n神様のご利益を狙ってのことだった。", "zh": "趁巡演间隙，舞滨步、永吉昴和野野原茜来到伏见稻荷大社观光。步被数量众多的鸟居震撼了。\n精力过剩的昴想去寻找狐狸，步和茜连忙阻止了她。原来，茜是想借此获得保佑生意兴隆的神明的庇佑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7e73c5e16bef3395d1cad7bd38a3e0f620056b64e58a99844a77f110afc12467", "ja": "（ツアーを頑張っているアイドルたちの休息と\n観光を兼ねて、京都の伏見稲荷にやってきた！）", "zh": "（为了让努力进行巡演的偶像们休息一下，也顺便观光，我们来到了京都的伏见稻荷！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area02_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7fb1617b86cb14860eb104e489bf0fd5fc99704ec03a89bf9e36d0dd354f9edc", "ja": "おお～、すごい鳥居の数！\nこれはアメリカじゃ絶対見られないやつだね。", "zh": "哦～，鸟居的数量真惊人！\n这种景象在美国绝对看不到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area02_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "e500980b5f6fb4159451843ac40d352c6cc717a4c24890e6a4f85d49e4afa695", "ja": "それに、階段もなっげー！\nここ往復してたら、足腰強くなるだろうな～。", "zh": "而且，台阶也太长了吧！\n要是来回走这里，腿脚肯定会变得更有劲吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area02_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "a956edaf604cc57454eaaed61a18d9dbdcc7133a3a9bde73c8bd29095db24cae", "ja": "なあ歩、せっかくだから競争しようぜ！\nどっちが先にてっぺん着くか！", "zh": "喂，步，难得来一趟，咱们比赛吧！\n看谁先到顶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "57d24e1dd204d350b7a8e44537648d072ccacb41b793e874075316e222f692b7", "ja": "昴、休日はちゃんと休まないと。それに\n他のお客さんもいるんだから、走っちゃダメだぞ。", "zh": "昴，休息日要好好休息才行。而且这里还有其他客人，不能跑啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area02_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "284e2e76e647ea57738eb05622f8337c8b45d8aee0257c36674b858f27a8fa44", "ja": "そうだよ、すばるん！　あんまりイタズラしてると、\nここの狐にお仕置きされちゃうかもだよ？", "zh": "就是嘛，昴昴！要是一直这么调皮，说不定会被这里的狐狸惩罚哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "36d653095c740baabd3821e671b1b357908b87e9d6d401c21c4fd9c437f9ce03", "ja": "伏見稲荷の狐は、神様の眷属になった話があるからな。\n無作法な人は、しっかり見られているかも……。", "zh": "伏见稻荷的狐狸据说成了神明的眷属。\n不懂礼数的人，说不定会被好好盯着……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area02_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "116df092b979f6c5fce4ffe5ad77ea6dd7663140fe5130eb5740521d57cc233d", "ja": "そ、そうなの？　確かに、普通の神社よりも\n雰囲気あるけどさ、ここ……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？这里确实比普通的神社更有氛围，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area02_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "538f90be1a7fbd67f631c1620e9f86b4c95f7220a2815fa75d9fe2b9a476cd6e", "ja": "へー、狐がいるんだ！\n歩、そこの茂みとか探しに……。", "zh": "诶——这里有狐狸啊！\n步，我们去那边的灌木丛找找……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area02_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "115214a5eccf3324010204a48f789176b2d8bfcb83f52188c60df9a8c4128fdf", "ja": "だ、ダメダメ！　ここには、神様がいるんだから！\nちゃんとしなくちゃ！", "zh": "不、不行不行！这里可是有神明在的！\n必须规规矩矩才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6bdb25eb2f292cf8ec6a6949019ad0a8d9d5bdb5c4de21f83fba029ae4ef8eae", "ja": "そういう事だ。それにしても、\n茜が助け舟を出してくれるとは思わなかったよ。", "zh": "就是这么回事。不过话说回来，真没想到茜会来帮忙解围。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area02_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "09cd9dc362152bf619028f5e1bb4a7aecdb0ecfad666befd5251cf3cc99f8303", "ja": "ふっふっふ……。この神社には商売繁盛のご利益が\nあることを、茜ちゃんはチェック済みなのだよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿……小茜已经确认过了，这座神社可是有保佑生意兴隆的灵验哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area02_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "7a9c43657e831d548cd2eed1978dd6014d6eeb94ca58cf8471bdb209fb217834", "ja": "神様にお願いして、商売繁盛するなら安いもの！\n{$P$}ちゃんも、ご利益もらおうね☆", "zh": "向神明祈愿，要是能生意兴隆，那可太值了！\n{$P$}，你也来求个保佑吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_area02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_area02_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6d9d033f5a21abf60e918552ef986245b0acccb20c66508feeabeb83b0074c05", "ja": "（その後はマナーを守りつつ、みんなで\n楽しく観光した。商売繁盛か……叶えないとな！）", "zh": "（之后大家遵守礼仪，愉快地游览了一番。生意兴隆吗……一定要让它实现才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
